	(descr "Vishay BFC2 808 series film-dielectric trimmer capacitor, Ø5 mm round housing, radial through-hole, top adjustment only, lead pitch P = 5.08 mm (0.2 in). Body per datasheet: H = 7.0 mm max (for Cmax ≤ 10 pF), W = 5.5 mm max, L = 7.3 mm max including terminal reach. Housing is round Ø ~5 mm centered between the two 0.4 mm dia leads. Minimum PCB hole 1.25 mm; drill specified here at 1.3 mm for margin. For 1.5-5 pF version, Vishay part number BFC2 808 20508 (top adjustment, P = 5.08 mm). Datasheet: Documentation/Components/vishay-trimmer-cap.pdf.")
